OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSANorthern line upgrades give green
OL,4,Alight to colour blind drivers
OL,5,
OL,6,FOsman Hassan has worked for TfL for
OL,7,Fmany years but it was only a few months
OL,8,Fago that he was able to achieve his
OL,9,Fdream of becoming a Tube train driver.
OL,11,FHassan has colour vision deficiency
OL,12,F(CVD), a condition commonly known as
OL,13,Fcolour blindness.
OL,15,FLondon Underground has historically
OL,16,Fdepended on red and green lights for
OL,17,Fits signalling system meaning a career
OL,18,Fas a train driver on most of the
OL,19,Fnetwork has not been possible for
OL,20,Fpeople with CVD for safety reasons.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
